<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="crxyy" id="crxyy" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue02e0c49" id="ue02e0c49">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u91a80274" id="u91a80274"> 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐝𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐋𝐨𝐨𝐤𝐮𝐩: 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤 𝐄𝐧𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐦</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u76caa4ab" id="u76caa4ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua77b9f91" id="ua77b9f91">稀疏性是智能系统中反复出现的一项设计原则，从生物神经回路到现代大语言模型，均体现这一思想。目前，这一原则主要通过混合专家架构实现，即利用条件计算扩展模型容量。由于能够在计算量不成比例增长的情况下大幅增加模型规模，MoE 已成为前沿模型事实上的标准架构</span></strong></p><ul list="u823ac1fa"><li fid="u09a21c36" data-lake-id="u20835965" id="u20835965"><span data-lake-id="ua82ef94a" id="ua82ef94a">尽管条件计算范式取得成功，语言信号的内在异质性仍表明，模型结构存在显著的优化空间。语言建模涉及两类性质不同的子任务：组合式推理与知识检索。前者需要深层、动态的计算，而文本中的相当一部分内容，例如命名实体和固定表达模式，则具有局部性、静态性和高度定型化的特征</span></li><li fid="u09a21c36" data-lake-id="ud63602f0" id="ud63602f0"><span data-lake-id="u0178b880" id="u0178b880">经典 <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span> 模型在捕捉此类局部依赖方面的有效性表明，这些规律天然适合通过计算开销较低的查表操作来表示</span></li><li fid="u09a21c36" data-lake-id="u7c01dcc0" id="u7c01dcc0"><span data-lake-id="ub2138b93" id="ub2138b93">由于标准 Transformer 缺乏原生的知识查找原语，当前大语言模型不得不通过计算来模拟检索。这一过程本质上是在运行时以高昂的代价重建一张静态查找表，将宝贵的串行计算深度耗费在简单操作上，而这些深度资源本可用于更高层次的推理</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubad01523" id="ubad01523"><strong><span data-lake-id="u15ee9ed4" id="u15ee9ed4">为使模型架构与语言的这种二重性相契合，主张引入一个互补的稀疏性维度：条件记忆</span></strong></p><ul list="u096c61f0"><li fid="u6e09df40" data-lake-id="ue82e0499" id="ue82e0499"><span data-lake-id="uf41818f7" id="uf41818f7">条件计算通过稀疏激活参数来处理动态逻辑，而条件记忆则依赖稀疏查表操作，检索表征固定知识的静态嵌入</span></li><li fid="u6e09df40" data-lake-id="u1a43a33a" id="u1a43a33a"><span data-lake-id="u44c0a570" id="u44c0a570">作为对这一范式的初步探索，重新考察 <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span> 嵌入这一典型实现方式：以局部上下文为键，通过常数时间复杂度 O(1) 的查表操作索引大规模嵌入表</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9cdb1e96" id="u9cdb1e96"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5e41d81" id="ub5e41d81" style="color: #E4495B">本文提出 Engram，一种以经典 <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span> 结构为基础的条件记忆模块，并融入分词器压缩、多头哈希、上下文感知门控和多分支集成等现代化改进</span></strong></p><ul list="ua932a714"><li fid="u7feb2167" data-lake-id="u19c35e09" id="u19c35e09"><span data-lake-id="u013bc4ed" id="u013bc4ed">为量化这两类原语之间的协同作用，提出稀疏性分配问题：在总参数预算固定的情况下，应如何在 MoE 专家与 Engram 记忆之间分配容量</span></li><li fid="u7feb2167" data-lake-id="u91ced789" id="u91ced789"><span data-lake-id="u41375823" id="u41375823">实验揭示一条明显的 U 形缩放定律，表明即便是简单的查表机制，只要将其作为一等建模原语，也能成为神经计算不可或缺的补充。在这一分配规律的指导下，将 Engram 模型扩展至 27B 参数规模。与参数量及 FLOPs 严格相同的 MoE-27B 基线相比，Engram-27B 在多个领域展现出更高的效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7fa7ec46" id="u7fa7ec46"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4ffc4b0" id="uc4ffc4b0">基于 LogitLens 和 CKA 的机制分析揭示这些收益的来源：Engram 减轻主干网络在浅层重建静态知识的负担，从而增加可用于复杂推理的有效深度</span></strong></p><ul list="ub253209f"><li fid="u516820c2" data-lake-id="ubd8a9745" id="ubd8a9745"><span data-lake-id="u97402404" id="u97402404">通过将局部依赖的处理交由查表机制承担，Engram 释放注意力容量，使其能够专注于全局上下文，从而在长上下文场景中展现出优异性能</span></li><li fid="u516820c2" data-lake-id="u23f2764f" id="u23f2764f"><span data-lake-id="ua1e42d9f" id="ua1e42d9f">与 MoE 的动态路由不同，Engram 采用确定性 ID 来支持运行时预取，实现通信与计算的重叠。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f563940" id="u2f563940" style="color: #5C0036">实验结果表明，将一张包含 100B 参数的表卸载至主机内存，仅会引入可忽略的额外开销。这表明，Engram 能够有效绕开 GPU 显存约束，从而支持大幅扩展参数规模</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6dcce30a" id="u6dcce30a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790839385359-85418584-4246-4ced-b0b8-6e7380d6ba32.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3ba96e47-a6de-4965-83cc-731d60e90dc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf97ae4d4-5d77-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A614.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A360%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A98912%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A868%2C%22originHeight%22%3A508%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%222-GRAMEMBEDDINA%22%2C%22x%22%3A464%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOC%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A351%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORSELBUCEPHALUS%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A465%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALEDDOTPRODUCT%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-GRAMEMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOCABEMBEDDINC%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUTHIDDER%22%2C%22x%22%3A407%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALEXANDER%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A379%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENGRAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALEXANDER%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A599%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GREAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HASH%22%2C%22x%22%3A690%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HASH%22%2C%22x%22%3A505%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A672%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GREAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A740%2C%22y%22%3A379%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOE%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONLY%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GREA%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AME%22%2C%22x%22%3A330%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A704%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A465%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A492%2C%22y%22%3A376%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LCOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A630%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80H%22%2C%22x%22%3A742%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A735%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A515%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f2f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7291fd48%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="I6jQh" id="I6jQh" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u51c1723d" id="u51c1723d">⛵ 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤 𝐄𝐧𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐦</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u35532967" id="u35532967"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb4d5911" id="ufb4d5911">Engram 是一种条件记忆模块，旨在通过从结构上分离静态模式存储与动态计算，增强 Transformer 主干网络</span></strong></p><ul list="u4f47c6fd"><li fid="u9d6437bb" data-lake-id="u9bd4fa97" id="u9bd4fa97"><span data-lake-id="u0638923f" id="u0638923f">形式上，给定输入序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%3D(x_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cx_T)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F117f13e2c9a7bfad50657b5cacaad307.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AfkWK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24c812ad" id="u24c812ad"> 以及第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08843ad184698b2d78d7a39e060b9574.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QQpy2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2aa58df5" id="u2aa58df5">层的隐藏状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BT%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82256c520449aff41153ad3b5d8dc622.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fSwfz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca9594fb" id="uca9594fb">，该模块通过两个功能阶段处理每个位置：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3cb09f6" id="ue3cb09f6">检索与融合</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf0eeb687" id="uf0eeb687"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f2be3aa" id="u8f2be3aa">第一阶段将局部上下文映射到静态记忆条目，具体包括分词器压缩，以及通过确定性哈希检索嵌入</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u425b73b5" id="u425b73b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73f80d2f" id="u73f80d2f">分词器压缩：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4e208ffa" id="u4e208ffa">尽管</span> <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span><span data-lake-id="ue1c4262d" id="ue1c4262d"> 模型通常直接作用于分词器的输出，但标准子词分词器优先考虑无损重建，因此往往会为语义等价的词项分配不同的 ID，例如 </span><code data-lake-id="u45f0e7e4" id="u45f0e7e4"><span data-lake-id="u5d08031c" id="u5d08031c">Apple</span></code><span data-lake-id="u7b296bff" id="u7b296bff"> 与 </span><code data-lake-id="u2b05d00e" id="u2b05d00e"><span data-lake-id="u9ef291fd" id="u9ef291fd">apple</span></code><span data-lake-id="u84f6f2a3" id="u84f6f2a3">。为最大化语义密度，引入一个词表投影层。预先计算一个满射函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D%3AV%5C%5Cto%20V%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70ff2d224a3c29045d65394eb8a1057c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FVxbT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c1d5ea4" id="u3c1d5ea4">，依据文本规范化后的等价关系，将原始 token ID 归并为规范标识符；所采用的规范化操作包括 NFKC 、小写转换等</span></p><ul list="ueff4c87f"><li fid="uabc1f2d2" data-lake-id="u2868db1d" id="u2868db1d"><span data-lake-id="ue4e7f0f7" id="ue4e7f0f7">对于位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eY1FA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ude651647" id="ude651647"> 处的 token，将其原始 ID </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jrTYJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf664e13e" id="uf664e13e">映射为规范 ID </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3858906e8d22fbf385f04e3bcb3813ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rz3cy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9fdc92b" id="ue9fdc92b">，从而构成后缀</span> <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span><span data-lake-id="uf462c902" id="uf462c902"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bt%2Cn%7D%3D(x_%7Bt-n%2B1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cx_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F235799b56a3a6a4a92358b9eff32ace2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XBngi%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0befc343" id="u0befc343"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4ec088e" id="ub4ec088e">多头哈希：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u83987533" id="u83987533">对所有可能的</span> <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span><span data-lake-id="u45db2d4a" id="u45db2d4a"> 所构成的组合空间直接进行参数化是不可行的。采用基于哈希的方案。为缓解哈希冲突，针对每个</span> <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span><span data-lake-id="ue8107f00" id="ue8107f00"> 阶数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGjF6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b878c9e" id="u8b878c9e"> 设置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sSGcp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50bc2715" id="u50bc2715">个不同的哈希头。每个头</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lJoO1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffca1f0d" id="uffca1f0d">通过确定性函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_%7Bn%2Ck%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f0f47cdc75d1a6c041de45aeb3a9fcd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SeKQu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b19539c" id="u6b19539c">，将压缩后的上下文映射为嵌入表</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bn%2Ck%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6447715e4e912370c9f3cd35b2210bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fJR7x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9063c05c" id="u9063c05c">中的索引，其中表的大小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bn%2Ck%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7e1eca71d203d91558ce0e81ac8ef46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PpfSn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ac2cd9c" id="u2ac2cd9c"> 为质数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3aa66b51" id="u3aa66b51" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bt%2Cn%2Ck%7D%5C%5Ctriangleq%5C%5Cvarphi_%7Bn%2Ck%7D(g_%7Bt%2Cn%7D)%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bt%2Cn%2Ck%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bn%2Ck%7D%5Bz_%7Bt%2Cn%2Ck%7D%5D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd6a69060c0af065cf9e484ba06bfa3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DyqMg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc988f419"><li fid="u85f8fea1" data-lake-id="uffa769f1" id="uffa769f1"><span data-lake-id="u311b20aa" id="u311b20aa">在实际实现中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_%7Bn%2Ck%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f0f47cdc75d1a6c041de45aeb3a9fcd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cam57%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffa08eb8" id="uffa08eb8">采用轻量级的乘法异或哈希。将所有检索得到的嵌入拼接起来，构成最终的记忆向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bmem%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c49f29e6ad419d3e36a52edb9af61b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qsery%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua904c60d" id="ua904c60d">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udb9e0fd6" id="udb9e0fd6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%5C%5Ctriangleq%5C%5Cmathop%7B%5C%5C%7C%7D%5C%5Climits_%7Bn%3D2%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Cmathop%7B%5C%5C%7C%7D%5C%5Climits_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BK%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bt%2Cn%2Ck%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9288d5f9f7e0548db9a9c1bfca3e907.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ABNdy%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7ac162c6" id="u7ac162c6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a3f1673" id="u1a3f1673">检索得到的嵌入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1efaded89e73a36ff99c6e91435d563.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yZY6S%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u54f1c8a5" id="u54f1c8a5">充当与上下文无关的先验。然而，由于这些嵌入是静态的，因此本身缺乏对上下文的适应能力，并可能因哈希冲突或多义性而引入噪声</span></strong></p><ul list="ubee00457"><li fid="u63dd83e9" data-lake-id="u84f570f3" id="u84f570f3"><span data-lake-id="uac21ca10" id="uac21ca10">为增强表达能力并消除这种歧义，采用一种受注意力机制启发的上下文感知门控机制。将当前隐藏状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7da655072cb606d866aed0b8354535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AArhq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c293b79" id="u5c293b79">作为动态 Query，该隐藏状态已通过前面的注意力层聚合全局上下文；检索得到的记忆</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1efaded89e73a36ff99c6e91435d563.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rjhHr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3e21dbf" id="uc3e21dbf">则作为 Key 和 Value 投影的共同输入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e17a220" id="u6e17a220" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_V%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed58973774fa737f17491c06e9601c81.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FMyZD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u05025247"><li fid="uf975ff8e" data-lake-id="ue6239a92" id="ue6239a92"><span data-lake-id="ue3bc859d" id="ue3bc859d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F155f1d40281920c07bcce499fe434d85.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TqiqQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94ecbb8c" id="u94ecbb8c">为可学习的投影矩阵。为保证梯度稳定性，先对 Query 和 Key 应用 RMSNorm，再计算标量门控值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb77064fbd2d8d47a6f1575f354c7f5c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vb288%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufdb2d415" id="ufdb2d415">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufe82b0ea" id="ufe82b0ea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbdb1618c3411eafc2facbf57ec51f5e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZyD6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf6a02606"><li fid="ud74160c3" data-lake-id="u1310ec61" id="u1310ec61"><span data-lake-id="ua78f10b0" id="ua78f10b0">门控后的输出定义为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D%7D_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F27d2a29062e64fca1ad8e6eaeff1e27c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m4ai7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24358f37" id="u24358f37">。这一设计能够实现语义对齐：如果检索得到的记忆 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1efaded89e73a36ff99c6e91435d563.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WtkWe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bf2d488" id="u5bf2d488"> 与当前上下文 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7da655072cb606d866aed0b8354535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fBvfe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc491d4b2" id="uc491d4b2"> 相矛盾，门控值 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jli1b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74f726f7" id="u74f726f7"> 将趋近于零，从而有效抑制噪声。</span></li><li fid="ud74160c3" data-lake-id="u395098a5" id="u395098a5"><span data-lake-id="uf8634e96" id="uf8634e96">最后，为扩大感受野并增强模型的非线性表达能力，引入短核逐通道因果卷积</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uddab3cde" id="uddab3cde" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctext%7BConv1D%7D(%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%7D))%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b35c14a2e11b9e1f05f8839568d5eb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JvvGP%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud32142eb" id="ud32142eb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f39771a" id="u9f39771a" style="color: #270070">Engram 模块通过残差连接集成到主干网络中：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2bb0905d34b94d60f396889c0a03c441.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mJUjN%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u58b82453" id="u58b82453" style="color: #270070">，随后执行标准的注意力和 MoE 计算。关键在于，Engram 并非应用于每一层；其具体插入位置经过优化，以在建模效果与系统级延迟约束之间取得平衡</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u33d58ec1" id="u33d58ec1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4adbd7c1" id="u4adbd7c1">在本研究中，采用先进的多分支架构作为默认主干网络，以替代标准的单流连接，其原因在于前者具有更强的建模能力。这一架构的显著特征是将残差流扩展为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WulUC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u01790c41" id="u01790c41">条并行分支，并通过可学习的连接权重调节信息流</span></strong></p><ul list="ub5b224bd"><li fid="u838ee741" data-lake-id="ueb872266" id="ueb872266"><span data-lake-id="u60408c8f" id="u60408c8f">尽管 Engram 模块本身与拓扑无关，但将其适配到这一多分支框架仍需进行结构优化，以平衡效率与表达能力</span></li><li fid="u838ee741" data-lake-id="ue4d81327" id="ue4d81327"><span data-lake-id="u6db067af" id="u6db067af">采用参数共享策略：所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rcgli%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b73cf10" id="u0b73cf10">条分支共享一张稀疏嵌入表和一个 Value 投影矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43c9fc520be742bb64cc5f0dd2618a16.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bYazS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d7eb620" id="u0d7eb620">，同时使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kvvjk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u391fb973" id="u391fb973">个不同的 Key 投影矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5E%7B(m)%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bm%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f94ab9e8487693d763db77c218ce265.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pd2FU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0e33ef9" id="ua0e33ef9">，以实现各分支特有的门控行为。对于隐藏状态为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5E%7B(m)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd06dded01917e13049f6f59180d61e9d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zwxt9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua40faed8" id="ua40faed8">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KvmGE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54d7d444" id="u54d7d444">条分支，其专属门控信号计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud572f76a" id="ud572f76a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B(m)%7D%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5E%7B(m)%7D)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5E%7B(m)%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65e3569945164a474da3fa533a676918.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fz9Yc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uddf93b3a"><li fid="u413a9cac" data-lake-id="u06d60efc" id="u06d60efc"><span data-lake-id="u38364ca7" id="u38364ca7">将这些独立的门控信号应用于共享的 Value 向量，以调制检索得到的记忆：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5E%7B(m)%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B(m)%7D%5C%5Ccdot(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_V%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2778f3b9733f37bd45c8fcf0f6f3b03e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TzRSx%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u413a9cac" data-lake-id="u3d144134" id="u3d144134"><span data-lake-id="u1ae1dcb0" id="u1ae1dcb0">这一设计使得各线性投影，即一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43c9fc520be742bb64cc5f0dd2618a16.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wWoQA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u45195475" id="u45195475">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22st5pC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1b450e18" id="u1b450e18">个不同的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5E%7B(m)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb0a79f2bbf97795e3b52d0cb2e4cff7e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E2M5N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f00e6c0" id="u7f00e6c0">，能够融合为一次稠密 FP8 矩阵乘法，从而最大限度地提高现代 GPU 的计算利用率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua36b6dc7" id="ua36b6dc7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u103cb878" id="u103cb878">模型参数规模的扩展通常受到 GPU 高带宽内存（HBM）有限容量的制约。然而，与依赖运行时隐藏状态进行动态路由的 MoE 不同，Engram 采用仅依赖输入 token ID 的确定性检索机制，自然地将参数存储与计算解耦。这种可预测性使训练与推理阶段均能够采用专门的优化策略</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u24d1ab97" id="u24d1ab97" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790840637365-45194670-77ec-423e-bf85-7b151e406177.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u48d33ef6-8405-47fb-b0e0-8d23450516b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf97ae4d4-5d77-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A628.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A377%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A90561%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1078%2C%22originHeight%22%3A646%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A272%2C%22y%22%3A418%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOCABEMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A271%2C%22y%22%3A479%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOCABEMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A572%2C%22y%22%3A377%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFLOADEDDSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A942%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)DSEATINFERENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A739%2C%22y%22%3A598%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A578%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)DSEATTRAINING%22%2C%22x%22%3A131%2C%22y%22%3A598%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMMUNICATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A841%2C%22y%22%3A483%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ILNPUTIDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A540%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A569%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITHDSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A593%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(SSD%2CDRAM)%22%2C%22x%22%3A949%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONDEVICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUTLDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A771%2C%22y%22%3A543%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITHDSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A594%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONHOST%22%2C%22x%22%3A866%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AII2AIL%22%2C%22x%22%3A199%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOE%22%2C%22x%22%3A87%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOE%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A323%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1efee%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u938c877c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub6d48a86"><li fid="u890d3e3b" data-lake-id="uff91581d" id="uff91581d"><span data-lake-id="uafc2a705" id="uafc2a705">在训练阶段，为容纳大规模嵌入表，采用标准模型并行，将嵌入表分片存储在可用的 GPU 上。通过 All-to-All 通信原语，在前向传播中收集被访问的嵌入行，并在反向传播中分发梯度，使总存储容量能够随加速器数量线性扩展</span></li><li fid="u890d3e3b" data-lake-id="u6d9c0315" id="u6d9c0315"><span data-lake-id="u421f2220" id="u421f2220">在推理阶段，这种确定性支持预取与计算重叠策略。由于记忆索引在前向传播之前便已确定，系统可以通过 PCIe 从容量充足的主机内存中异步检索嵌入。为有效隐藏通信延迟，将 Engram 模块放置在主干网络的特定层，利用前面各层的计算过程提供缓冲时间，避免 GPU 停顿。这要求采用硬件与算法协同设计策略：虽然将 Engram 放置在更深的层能够延长用于隐藏延迟的计算窗口，但从建模性能来看，更早引入 Engram 以分担局部模式重建任务更为有利。因此，最优插入位置必须同时兼顾建模需求与系统延迟约束</span></li><li fid="u890d3e3b" data-lake-id="u4b5d9432" id="u4b5d9432"><span data-lake-id="u639441f0" id="u639441f0">自然语言中的 </span> <span lang="en" class="engram-term">N-gram</span><span data-lake-id="u498d7bf7" id="u498d7bf7"> 天然遵循 Zipf 分布，即少量模式贡献绝大多数记忆访问。这一统计特性促使采用多级缓存层次结构：将频繁访问的嵌入缓存在速度更快的存储层中，例如 GPU HBM 或主机 DRAM，而将长尾的低频模式存储在速度较慢但容量较大的介质中，例如 NVMe SSD。这种分层设计使 Engram 能够在对实际延迟影响极小的情况下，实现记忆容量的大规模扩展</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u63ecd873" id="u63ecd873"><br></p>